The '''Lagoon Hut''' is a location in the [[Rift Dimension]]. It is based on the {{zone|Fisherman's Hut}}.

== Features ==
The '''Lagoon Hut''' features a few attractions. The player must cross the {{zone|Black Lagoon}} with {{Item|Lil' Pad}}s in order to access the location.

=== Reed ===
{{Main|Reed}}
Located at the back of the '''Lagoon Hut''' is {{NPCSprite|Reed}}, an [[NPC]] who tasks the player with obtaining different items. There are {{Green|5}} steps, each one requiring a different amount and type of item. After completing all five, [[Reed]] will offer the player [[Rift Boat]] for {{Motes|25,000}}, which is needed in order to access the {{zone|Stillgore Château}}.

=== The Gill-Man ===
{{See also|Porhtal}}
One of [[Porhtal]]'s eyes, The Gill-Man, can be found in the basement of the '''Lagoon Hut'''. The eye's condition is {{DarkRed|'''ROGUE'''}}, and can be defeated to gain a permanent {{stat|rt|+20}} and the ability to instantly teleport to it from [[Porhtal]] or any of their other eyes. Teleporting to The Gill-Man costs {{stat|rt|5s}} if the player has entered the {{zone|Black Lagoon}} and can only be done if the player has enough time remaining.

